  "body": "Positioned at the pinnacle of this boutique residence, this exceptional penthouse delivers a lifestyle defined by space, privacy and breathtaking outlooks. Framed by sweeping vistas spanning Hobson Bay, the glittering city skyline, Rangitoto and the Hauraki Gulf, the outlook is nothing short of captivating.\r\nSpanning approximately 200sqm internally, the expansive floorplan has been thoughtfully designed to embrace its extraordinary setting, with open-plan living and entertaining spaces flowing seamlessly to a generous 22sqm terrace.\r\nBeautifully appointed throughout, the home offers three bedrooms, three bathrooms and a sophisticated blend of comfort, scale and contemporary design.\r\nPremium finishes, ducted climate control, three secure internal car parks and a generous plumbed storage locker enhance the ease of everyday living, while the coveted lock-up-and-leave location places you moments from waterfront walkways, Coates Avenue village, Eastridge and the CBD.\r\nA rare offering of substance and style, where world-class views, exceptional proportions and effortless luxury combine.\r\nCall now for your appointment to view.",
